Maintainer: Khronos31 <39792509+Khronos31@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/TryGhost/node-sqlite3
Tag: role::shared-lib
Description: Node.js sqlite3 native addon
 npm sqlite3 5.1.7 built for Mayflower Node 24 (aarch64-apple-ios).
 Installs require("sqlite3") next to node-bin, at
 /var/jb/usr/lib/nodejs-24/node_modules/sqlite3. Not the Procursus
 sqlite3 CLI or libsqlite3-1; EPGStation loads this addon with dlopen.
 Cross-built on Mac. Do not npm install sqlite3 on the device.
